# On-chain audit anchoring (optional — see README "On-chain audit anchoring").
#
# The agent never accepts a mnemonic/private key directly as an env var
# value; it only accepts a *path* to a local wallet note file, so the secret
# itself never ends up in `.env`, shell history, or process environment
# dumps. Point this at a plain-text file containing a 12/24-word BIP-39
# mnemonic on its own line (Phantom-style, derivation path m/44'/501'/0'/0').
# devnet only — this wallet should never hold, and this code never sends,
# anything but devnet (worthless) SOL.
ODDS_MM_SOLANA_MNEMONIC_FILE=/path/to/your/devnet-wallet-note.txt

# Defaults to the public Solana devnet RPC; override for a private/faster
# devnet endpoint if you have one.
ODDS_MM_SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.devnet.solana.com
